('Alouda', 'Mauritius', 'Africa', true, 'Drinks', 'alouda-mauritius',
'Mauritian sweet milk drink with basil seeds, rose syrup, and agar-agar jelly - a refreshing treat.',
'Alouda has Indian origins but has been uniquely adapted in Mauritius. The colorful drink with its floating basil seeds is a must-try for visitors and a daily indulgence for locals.',
